        "id": 1003446
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-13T15:41:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Start capture\nuse buffer in command (buffers are only captured if used in submit)\nsubmit calls AddResource for every used buffer\nuser calls mapAsync(write) / unmap\nuse buffer in command (buffers are only captured if used in submit)\nsubmit calls AddResource for every used buffer\n\nThe 2nd call to submit needs to recapture the buffer because the user modified it.",
      "parentUuid": "70f1eab4_8b60b503",
      "revId": "2f61752c7d75f9b588406cf301e79244127dc248",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
